break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Buddiesの皆さんの声、舞台の裏まで届いていて、その声を聞いて勇気をもらっていました☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブって楽しいなと改めて感じた1日でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⋆⋅⋅⋅⊱∘─────────────∘⊰⋅⋅⋅⋆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日お疲れ様☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月も素敵な1ヶ月にしようね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もゆっくり休んでね💫"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#9"}],"source":"official"}}